  "prompt": "For the users who signed up from September to December 2025, how many were active in each of their first three months? A user's cohort month is the month of signup_ts, and a user is active in a month with at least one activation event of any kind, by the month of event_ts; both are UTC instants, so read months in UTC. The month offset counts calendar months from the cohort month, from 0 to 2. The as-of date is 5 January 2026: a month that ends after it is not known yet and shows missing, while a month that has ended with no active user shows 0. Return three columns, in this order: cohort_month (the first day of the month), month_offset and active_users. Return one row for each cohort month that has signups and each month offset from 0 to 2. Any row order is fine.",
